{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q001", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_prose_poetry", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "speech_and_poetry_language", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நேரடி மொழிதான் (Direct Speech) ஒரு கவிஞனை அவனது உண்மையான உணர்ச்சிகளோடு இணைக்கிறது\" என்று 'பேச்சுமொழியும் கவிதைமொழியும்' கட்டுரையில் குறிப்பிட்ட கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இந்திரன் (இராசேந்திரன்)", "B": "வாலி", "C": "வைரமுத்து", "D": "நா. காமராசன்"}, "explanation": "கலைவிமர்சகரும் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி மொழிபெயர்ப்பு விருது பெற்றவருமான கவிஞர் இந்திரன் (இராசேந்திரன்) பேச்சுமொழியே கவிதைமொழிக்கு உயிர்ப்பூட்டும் நேரடி வடிவம் என்று நிறுவினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which poet emphasized in 'Peechumozhiyum Kavithaimozhiyum' that direct colloquial speech binds a poet authentically to genuine emotions?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Indiran (Rajendran)", "B": "Vaali", "C": "Vairamuthu", "D": "Na. Kamarasan"}, "explanation": "Poet and art critic Indiran argued that living speech directly channels poetic consciousness."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 5, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 5", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Prose", "Language"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q002", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_prose_poetry", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "yugathin_paadal_vilvarathinam", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"என் புன்னகையை ஒரு காற்றில் பறக்கவிட்டு\nகாத்திருக்கிறேன் என் கவிதைக்காக...\"\n- என்று 'யுகத்தின் பாடல்' கவிதையில் ஈழத் தமிழரின் மொழித் தாகத்தைப் பாடிய கவிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சேரன்", "B": "சு. வில்வரத்தினம்", "C": "காசி ஆனந்தன்", "D": "புதுவை இரத்தினதுரை"}, "explanation": "ஈழத்துக் கவிஞரான சு. வில்வரத்தினம் (புங்குடுதீவு) இயற்றிய 'உயிர்த்தெழும் காலத்துக்காக' தொகுப்பில் உள்ள 'யுகத்தின் பாடல்' தமிழ் மொழியின் வரலாற்றுத் தொடர்ச்சியைப் பாடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who penned the moving verses longing for linguistic and cultural rebirth in 'Yugathin Paadal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Cheran", "B": "Su. Vilvarathinam", "C": "Kasi Anandan", "D": "Puthuvai Rathinathurai"}, "explanation": "Eelam poet Su. Vilvarathinam composed the stirring anthem 'Yugathin Paadal'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition":