{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_prose_poetry", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aingurunooru_five_poets", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐங்குறுநூற்றின் ஐந்து திணைகளைப் பாடிய புலவர்களைப் பொருத்துக:\n(அ) மருதம் - 1. ஓரம்போகியார்\n(ஆ) நெய்தல் - 2. அம்மூவனார்\n(இ) குறிஞ்சி - 3. கபிலர்\n(ஈ) பாலை - 4. ஓதலாந்தையார்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-3", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-4, இ-1, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-3, இ-2, ஈ-1"}, "explanation": "மருதம் - ஓரம்போகியார்; நெய்தல் - அம்மூவனார்; குறிஞ்சி - கபிலர்; பாலை - ஓதலாந்தையார்; முல்லை - பேயனார் என்பதே ஐங்குறுநூற்றின் மரபுசார் திணைப் புலவர் வைப்பாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the five landscapes of Aingurunooru with their respective Sangam poets:\n(a) Marutham - 1. Orambogiyar\n(b) Neithal - 2. Ammoovanaar\n(c) Kurinchi - 3. Kapilar\n(d) Paalai - 4. Othalaanthaiyaar", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1"}, "explanation": "Marutham (Orambogiyar), Neithal (Ammoovanaar), Kurinchi (Kapilar), Paalai (Othalaanthaiyaar)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 32, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 32", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Poetry", "Aingurunooru"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q022", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_prose_poetry", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nannool_seven_matham", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நன்னூல் சிறப்புப்பாயிரத்தில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் 'எழுவகை மதம்' என்பதில் 'மதம்' என்னும் சொல் உணர்த்தும் பொருள் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மதவெறி", "B": "கொள்கை / சித்தாந்தக் கோட்பாடு (Doctrine / Creed)", "C": "மயக்கம்", "D": "செல்வம்"}, "explanation": "'மதம்' என்பது ஆசிரியர்கள் தத்தம் நூல்களில் மேற்கொள்ளும் ஏழு வகையான கொள்கை அல்லது கோட்பாடுகளைக் குறிக்கும் (உடன்படல், மறுத்தல் போன்றவை)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Nannool's concept of 'Ezhu Vagai Matham', what does the term 'Matham' strictly denote?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Religious sectarianism", "B": "Scholarly doctrinal stance / Theoretical thesis", "C": "Intoxication", "D": "Wealth"}, "explanation": "'Matham' signifies doctrinal positions or authorial theoretical stances in classical poetics."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 7, "chapter": null