{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q052", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u2_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "punarchi_thirithal_vikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "புணர்ச்சியில் இரண்டு சொற்கள் இணையும் போது ஒரு மெய்யெழுத்து மற்றொரு மெய்யெழுத்தாக மாறுவது (எ.கா: பல் + பொடி = பற்பொடி) எவ்வகைப் புணர்ச்சி விகாரமாகும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தோன்றல் விகாரம்", "B": "கெடுதல் விகாரம்", "C": "இயல்புப் புணர்ச்சி", "D": "திரிதல் விகாரம் (Alteration)"}, "explanation": "ஒரு எழுத்து வேறோர் எழுத்தாகத் திரிந்து மாறுவது 'திரிதல் விகாரம்' எனப்படும் (ல் -> ற்; ள் -> ட்)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In sandhi transformations, when a consonant mutates into another phoneme (e.g., pal + podi = parpodi), which sandhi mutation is instantiated?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thondral (Augmentation)", "B": "Keduthal (Elision)", "C": "Iyalbu (Natural junction)", "D": "Thirithal (Mutation / Alteration)"}, "explanation": "Mutation of one consonant into another constitutes Thirithal Vikaram."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "e