{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q133", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pagupatham_vanthaan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'வந்தான்' என்னும் சொல்லில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள விகாரங்கள் (Morphological mutations) எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வா என்பது 'வ' எனக் குறுகியது விகாரம்; த் என்பது 'ந்' எனத் திரிந்தது விகாரம்", "B": "ஆன் என்பது அன் ஆனது", "C": "காலம் மாறியது", "D": "விகுதி கெட்டது"}, "explanation": "'வந்தான்' = வா(வ) + த்(ந்) + த் + ஆன். இதில் பகுதி 'வா' குறுகியதும் (வ), சந்தி 'த்' மெலிந்ததும் (ந்) ஆகிய இரண்டு விகாரங்கள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What two morphological mutations (Vikarams) occur within the dissection of 'Vanthaan' (He came)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Root Vaa shortening to Va, and junction plosive th mutating to nasal n (th to n)", "B": "Suffix aan becoming an", "C": "Tense shift", "D": "Suffix elision"}, "explanation": "Both the root shortening (vaa to va) and the junction nasalization (th to n) are classical vikarams."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 73, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 73", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Grammar", "Pagupatham"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q134", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thirukkural_yaakaavaaraayinum", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"யாகாவா ராயினும் நாகாக்க காவாக்கால்\nசோகாப்பர் சொல்லிழுக் கப் பட்டு\" - இக்குறட்பா வலியுறுத்தும் இன்றியமையாத அடக்கம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உடல் அடக்கம்", "B": "நாவடக்கம் (பேச்சில் நிதானம்)", "C": "பார்வை அடக்கம்", "D": "செவி அடக்கம்"}, "explanation": "எவற்றைக் காக்க முடியாவிட்டாலும் நாவையாவது அடக்கிக் காக்க வேண்டும்; அவ்வாறு காக்காவிடில் சொற்குற்றத்தில் சிக்கித் துன்புறுவர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which cardinal discipline of restraint is emphasized in 'Yaakaavaa Raayinum Naagaakka Kaavaakkaal Sogaappar Sollizhukkap Pattu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Physical bodily restraint", "B": "Restraint of the tongue (Verbal prudence)", "C": "Restraint of gaze", "D": "Restraint of hearing"}, "explanation": "Valluvar urges that whatever else one fails to restrain, one must bridle one's tongue."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 78, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit revision_megapack_1, Page 78", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 11", "Revision 1", "Thirukkural", "Adakkam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q135", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u3_u4_supp_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chellappa_literary_generation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்தாளர் சி. சு. செல்லப்பா எந்த வரலாற்று இலக்கியக் குழுவைச் சார்ந்த முன்னோடி எழுத்தாளராவார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வானம்பாடி இயக்கம்", "B": "மறுமலர்ச்சி எழுத்தாளர் சங்கம்", "C": "மணிக்கொடி எழுத்தாளர் தலைமுறை", "D": "முற்போக்கு எழுத்தாளர் சங்கம்"}, "explanation": "சி. சு. செல்லப்பா 1930-களில் தமிழ் உரைநடை இலக்கியத்தை நவீனப்படுத்திய 'மணிக்கொடி' எழுத்தாளர் தலைமுறையைச் சேர்ந்த முதன்மையான படைப்பாளியாவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which historic literary vanguard generation did writer C. S. Chellappa belong?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaanambaadi movement", "B": "Renaissance Writers Union", "C": "The Manikkodi literary generation", "D": "Progressive Writers Association"}, "explanation": "C. S. Chellappa was an illustrious luminary of the legendary Manikkodi generation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2