{"id": "11th_tamil_rev1_q147", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "revision_megapack_1", "lesson_id": "rev_u1_u4_grammar", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thisaippeyar_punarchi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திசைப்பெயர்ப் புணர்ச்சியில் \"வடக்கு + கிழக்கு\" என்பது எவ்வாறு புணரும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வடகிழக்கு", "B": "வடக்குகிழக்கு", "C": "வடகிழக்கு (ஈற்று 'க்கு' கெட்டு 'வடகிழக்கு' என்றானது)", "D": "வடக்குக்கு கிழக்கு"}, "explanation": "திசைப்பெயரின் முன் திசைப்பெயர் வரும்போது நிலைமொழி ஈற்று 'க்கு' கெட்டு 'வடகிழக்கு' எனப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In directional nominal sandhi (Thisaippeyar Punarchi), how does 'Vadakku + Kizhakku' legitimately coalesce?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vadakkizhakku", "B": "Vadakkukizhakku", "C": "Vadakizhakku (elision of terminal -kku yielding Vadakizhakku)", "D": "Vadakkukku kizhakku"}, "explanation": "The terminal -kku elides cleanly: Vadakku + Kizhakku = Vadakizhakku."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 75, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "11th Tamil, Unit